</script><div class="apexp"><div id="j_id0:j_id1" class="bPageBlock brandSecondaryBrd apexDefaultPageBlock secondaryPalette"><div class="pbHeader"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="pbTitle"><h2 class="mainTitle">Biodiversity Offset Credit Transaction Report</h2></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></div><div class="pbBody">Date and Time Extracted: 5/10/2026 1:20 PM
        
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="9">The department is required by legislation to keep public registers under the BOS. The public registers are established in accordance with the Biodiversity Conservation Act 2016 and the Biodiversity Conservation Regulation 2017. The purpose of information provided on the public registers is to facilitate the biodiversity credit market and to connect credit buyers and sellers. By accessing and downloading data from the public registers you agree that you will only use this information for purposes relating to the purpose of the registers or the Biodiversity Conservation Act 2016 or the Biodiversity Conservation Regulation 2017.</td>
            </tr> 
            <tr>
                <td colspan="9">The Biodiversity Conservation Act 2016 requires the Department to include the names and contact details of some individuals on public registers on the Department's website. If you would prefer that your name and/or contact details are not published on the public registers, please contact the Department at BOSCREDITS@environment.nsw.gov.au and include the reasons for your request. In particular, please inform the Department if you consider including your name or contact details on the public register will affect your safety or wellbeing.</td>        
            </tr> 
            <tr>
                <td colspan="9">The Department can restrict information from its public registers if the Department considers it is not in the public interest to disclose the information. The Department is also required to not disclose or publish (or if already published, to remove) personal information from a public register if that the Department considers placing the information on the register affects the safety or wellbeing of any person - unless the Department considers that the public interest in maintaining public access to the information outweighs any individual interest in suppressing the information from the register.</td>
            </tr>            
        </table><table class="list" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><colgroup span="24"></colgroup><thead class=""><tr class="headerRow"><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id11header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id11header:sortDiv">Transaction Date</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id14header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id14header:sortDiv">Transaction ID</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id15header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id15header:sortDiv">Transaction Status</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id16header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id16header:sortDiv">Transaction Type</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id17header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id17header:sortDiv">From</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id18header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id18header:sortDiv">To</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id19header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id19header:sortDiv">Plant Community Type</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id20header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id20header:sortDiv">Sub Region</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id21header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id21header:sortDiv">Offset Trading Group</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id22header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id22header:sortDiv">Vegetation Formation</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id23header"><div id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id23header:sortDiv">Scientific Name</div></th><th class="headerRow" scope="col" colspan="1" id="j_id0:j_id1:j_id10:j_id24header"><div i